      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
