  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let required plane is (using concept of family of plane)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Again <math><mi>D</mi><mi>R</mi></math> of <math><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo></math> axis is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Since plane is parallel to <math><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo></math> axis</p><p>Hence <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> required plane is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Which satisfy <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"
  }
